//
//   - Non-TTY: [DumpSink, SynthesisSink?] — narrative dump plus profile-native
//     final report when autoSynthesis is enabled.
//   - TTY: [TUISink, DumpSink, SynthesisSink?] — TUI owns the live dashboard;
